<title>UK: SOCCER SHOWCASE-MANCHESTER UNITED BEAT LIVERPOOL 1-0.</title>
<headline>SOCCER SHOWCASE-MANCHESTER UNITED BEAT LIVERPOOL 1-0.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manchester United</p>
<p>beat Liverpool 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in their English premier</p>
<p>league match at Old Trafford on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorer: David Beckham (23rd minute)</p>
<p>Attendance: 55,128</p>
<p>Leading standings (tabulated under played, won, drawn, lost,</p>
<p>goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Liverpool		 9  6  2  1 18  7   20</p>
<p> Manchester United     9  5  4  0 19  6   19</p>
<p> Newcastle		 8  6  0  2 14 10   18</p>
<p> Arsenal		   8  5  2  1 17  8   17</p>
<p> Wimbledon		 8  5  0  3 12  7   15</p>
<p> Chelsea		   8  3  4  1 11 10   13</p>
</text>
